1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
一碗凉粉，是豌豆磨出来的
This jelly noodle is milled from peas

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:04,700
豌豆去壳，泡水磨浆
Shelled peas, soaked and ground to slurry

3
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:07,000
过滤沉淀，熬成糊
Filtered, settled, cooked to a paste

4
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:09,300
晾凉切条，滑溜溜
Cooled and cut into slippery strands

5
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:11,600
灵魂，是那一勺红油
The soul is that spoon of chili oil

6
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:14,100
辣椒下瓦罐，埋土里一个月
Chilies steeped underground for a month

7
00:00:14,100 --> 00:00:16,500
红油一浇，堆到冒尖
Chili oil piled till it overflows

8
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:18,900
蒜水、花椒、一把葱
Garlic water, Sichuan pepper, scallions

9
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:21,400
清末南充，谢天禄摆的摊
Born at Xie Tianlu's Qing-era stall

10
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:23,800
一口下去，巴适得板
One bite — "bāshì", pure Sichuan bliss

11
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:26,600
红油越多越香？评论区见
More chili oil = better? Tell us
